  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> . Then the number of elements in the set {<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math>}&nbsp;is _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Therefore the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;is true for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;so, only one set is possible.</p>"
